      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "I've identified the issue with your mobile data.\n\n**The Problem:** Your plan (Premium Plan) includes **15 GB** of data per month, but you've currently used **15.1 GB**. When your data usage exceeds your plan's limit, data connectivity is lost or severely limited. This explains why you're having no data or very slow speeds.\n\n**Your Options:**\n\n1. **Refuel Data** – You can add more data to your line at **$2.00 per GB** (up to 2 GB maximum). Even 1 GB would restore your data connectivity immediately.\n\n2. **Change Your Plan** – I can help you switch to a plan with a higher data limit if you find yourself regularly exceeding 15 GB.\n\nSince you've stated that excellent internet speed is your only acceptable resolution, the quickest fix would be to refuel some data to get you back online right away.\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Add some data (up to 2 GB) for $2.00 per GB? Let me know how many GB you'd like.\n- Or explore different plan options?\n\nAlso, is there anything else on your device that might be affecting your speeds (such as Data Saver mode being enabled)?",
